"**gadzooks! you are invited to become a moderator of [%(title)s](%(url)s)!**\n"
"\n"
"*to accept*, visit the [moderators page for %(url)s](%(url)s/about/moderators) and click \"accept\".\n"
"\n"
"*otherwise,* if you did not expect to receive this, you can simply ignore this invitation or report it.\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"*Before accepting, we encourage you to review our [Moderator Guidelines](/help/moderatorguidelines) to understand the expectations and responsibilities of being a moderator.*"
msgstr ""
"**gle čuda! pozvani ste da postanete moderator vaulta [%(title)s](%(url)s)!**\n"
"\n"
"*da biste prihvatili*, posjetite [stranicu moderatora za %(url)s](%(url)s/about/moderators) i kliknite „prihvati“.\n"
"\n"
"*u suprotnom*, ako niste očekivali ovo, jednostavno možete zanemariti ovu pozivnicu ili je prijaviti.\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"*Prije nego što prihvatite, preporučujemo da pročitate naše [Smjernice za moderatore](/help/moderatorguidelines) kako biste razumjeli očekivanja i odgovornosti moderatora.*"

